<title>USA: BOXING-TALE OF THE TAPE FOR TYSON-HOLYFIELD.</title>
<headline>BOXING-TALE OF THE TAPE FOR TYSON-HOLYFIELD.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tale of the tape after the</p>
<p>weigh-in Friday for the World Boxing Association heavyweight</p>
<p>title fight scheduled for 12-rounds between champion Mike</p>
<p>Tyson and Evander Holyfield on Saturday:</p>
<p>    Evander Holyfield			     Mike Tyson</p>
<p>    34			Age		     30</p>
<p>    215 lbs (97.5 kg)   Weight		  222 (100.6)</p>
<p>    6'2&quot; (1.87 m)	 Height		  5'11&quot; (1.52 m)</p>
<p>    77&quot; (195.5 cm)	Reach		   71&quot; (180.3 cm)</p>
<p>    43&quot; (109 cm)	  Chest (Normal)	43&quot; (109 cm)</p>
<p>    45&quot; (114 cm)	  Chest (Expanded)    45&quot; (114 cm)</p>
<p>    16&quot; (41 cm)	   Biceps		  16&quot; (41 cm)</p>
<p>    12.5 (31.7 cm)	Forearms		14&quot; (35.5 cm)</p>
<p>    32&quot; (81 cm)	   Waist		   34&quot; (86 cm)</p>
<p>    22&quot; (55.8 cm)	 Thigh		   27&quot; (68.5 cm)</p>
<p>    13&quot; (33 cm)	   Calf		    19&quot; (48 cm)</p>
<p>    19.5 (49.5 cm)	Neck		    20&quot; (50.8 cm)</p>
<p>     7.5&quot; (19 cm)	 Wrist		    8&quot; (20 cm)</p>
<p>    12.5&quot; 31.7 cm)	Fist		    13&quot; (33 cm)</p>
